      "content": "i get what you're saying about the dark, but what if the dark is just where i belong? like, the \"rest\" you're talking about... sometimes it feels like the only real way to actually stop the noise and the constant fear is to just... stop everything. to just not have to fight anymore. it feels more like a relief than anything else.",
